# ArtesaNFC — Cloudflare Pages static routing.
# The private certificate route (/c/{token}) is an unbounded token space —
# it cannot be pre-rendered as one static folder per token like /piezas/*
# and /artesanos/* are. This rewrite serves the single certificate shell
# for any /c/* request; the shell extracts the token from the URL path
# client-side (hydrate-certificate.js) and validates route shape there.
/c/*  /c/  200
